{"2521950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deaduction", "steam_appid": 2521950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >                                               <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/cb3241b27360aefea480cb4ebcb62609.avif?t=1780970624\" width=350 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six workers begin another night shift at a mysterious hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook meals, maintain the building, care for guests, and keep the hotel running. But beneath the routine lies a terrifying secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not everyone is human.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/09a44543efb2175907172716cf9f7eb0.poster.avif?t=1780970624\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/09a44543efb2175907172716cf9f7eb0.webm?t=1780970624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/09a44543efb2175907172716cf9f7eb0.mp4?t=1780970624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                             </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >                                                                      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/ed8c50c93a89b9bcc7efef8db807e279.webp?t=1780970624\" width=125 height=38 /></span>                                                        </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Spirits hide among the staff,</strong> blending in while secretly plotting their downfall. <br>Use <strong>deception</strong>, <strong>sabotage</strong>, and <strong>murder</strong> to eliminate the innocent without revealing your true identity.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Poltergeist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possess objects throughout the hotel and turn the environment into a weapon. Drop chandeliers, launch vases, lock doors, sabotage tasks, and create deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disguise yourself as a prop and stalk your victims from the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Doppelganger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disguise yourself as another staff member and earn the group's trust before striking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crime leaves evidence behind. Stay hidden, frame the innocent, and avoid the <strong>Security Guard</strong> long enough to finish the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/1cdcac8d9145f1db5027dcd865a09559.poster.avif?t=1780970624\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/1cdcac8d9145f1db5027dcd865a09559.webm?t=1780970624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/1cdcac8d9145f1db5027dcd865a09559.mp4?t=1780970624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                     </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >                                                                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/4c4104fe88c08c39101f4601b0e5c8d4.webp?t=1780970624\" width=125 height=38 /></span>                                                       </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Staff</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hotel can't run itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow fresh produce as the <strong>Gardener</strong>, prepare meals as the <strong>Chef</strong>, deliver orders as the <strong>Bellboy</strong>, assist guests as the <strong>Receptionist</strong>, maintain the building as the <strong>Caretaker</strong>, or patrol the halls as the <strong>Security</strong> <strong>Guard</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your earnings on powerful tools and equipment such as EMF Readers, Holy Water Sprayers, and Antique Pistols. Use them to expose Spirits, protect innocent staff, and fight back against the horrors stalking the hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your coworkers carefully. Strange behaviour, missing guests, broken equipment, and unexplained accidents may all point toward something far more sinister lurking within the staff.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Security Guard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Security Guard is responsible for investigating suspicious activity throughout the hotel. Search staff members, monitor surveillance cameras, collect evidence, and track down the killers hiding among your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth is out there—you just need to survive long enough to find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/2f3c6efdc12a29db5e020a06dc51028a.poster.avif?t=1780970624\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/2f3c6efdc12a29db5e020a06dc51028a.webm?t=1780970624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/2f3c6efdc12a29db5e020a06dc51028a.mp4?t=1780970624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decide Their Fate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every problem can be solved with a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather at the meeting table to share evidence, question suspects, and vote on who should be jailed. As the night progresses, accusations become convictions, and convictions become executions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust no one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has a job to do, but not everyone is who they claim to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >                                               <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/cb3241b27360aefea480cb4ebcb62609.avif?t=1780970624\" width=350 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six workers begin another night shift at a mysterious hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook meals, maintain the building, care for guests, and keep the hotel running. But beneath the routine lies a terrifying secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not everyone is human.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/09a44543efb2175907172716cf9f7eb0.poster.avif?t=1780970624\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/09a44543efb2175907172716cf9f7eb0.webm?t=1780970624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/09a44543efb2175907172716cf9f7eb0.mp4?t=1780970624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                             </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >                                                                      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor