t=1780970624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/extras/2f3c6efdc12a29db5e020a06dc51028a.mp4?t=1780970624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decide Their Fate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every problem can be solved with a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather at the meeting table to share evidence, question suspects, and vote on who should be jailed. As the night progresses, accusations become convictions, and convictions become executions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust no one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has a job to do, but not everyone is who they claim to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      </p>", "short_description": "An otherworldly murder mystery blending horror, prop hunt, and supernatural powers. Work the night shift in a possessed hotel as an innocent staff member, a poltergeist controlling objects, or a body swapping doppelganger. Earn money to buy tools to uncover the imposters and survive the night shift.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/header.jpg?t=1780970624", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/5e0ef78b50eb8200ca099da0febe5e30688b6a49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780970624", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521950/5e0ef78b50eb8200ca099da0febe5e30688b6a49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780970624", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 @ 3.3GHz (4th Generation) or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 or A